     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi folks,<div><br></div><div>As we near the beginning of the fall quarter, your trusty R gurus are getting plans finalized for another academic year of programming delights! As we weigh the pros and cons of different meeting formats, we are reaching out to seek your feedback on attendance options. We are planning to reserve a room at the library, as we did back in the good old days, but are also thinking about remote options for folks who cannot/prefer not to attend a live D-RUG meeting.</div><div><br></div><div>Please fill out <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfBswrlTav0OEreTFaiK3bQkRHCUXmzchCgVAotkXwI7B_OXA/viewform?usp=sf_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfBswrlTav0OEreTFaiK3bQkRHCUXmzchCgVAotkXwI7B_OXA/viewform?usp%3Dsf_link&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465162402000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dlpf6ooEWhQ7fp948jC-_\">this poll</a> to indicate your interest in in-person vs. hybrid meetings.</div><div><br></div><div>Looking forward to seeing you this fall!</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Christian, Christine, Liza, Martha, Michael, Ryan, and Wesley<br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Christian John — Ph.D. candidate</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">NASA FINESST Future Investigator</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Pronouns: he/him/his</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><div><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=VPd60tMAAAAJ&amp;view_op=list_works&amp;authuser=1&amp;sortby=pubdate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl%3Den%26user%3DVPd60tMAAAAJ%26view_op%3Dlist_works%26authuser%3D1%26sortby%3Dpubdate&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465162402000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2TP39glO-7bgZ01JDHlo6s\">Google Scholar</a></div><div><a href=\"https://jepsonnomad.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jepsonnomad.github.io/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465162402000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3NX-lFlchJCcMGGOAUkm8O\">Christian&#39;s Website</a></div><div><br></div></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Graduate Group in Ecology</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Academic+Surge/@38.5352334,-121.7532526,19z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x808529101a2c2a05:0x437ec7ca5a00065!8m2!3d38.5352324!4d-121.7527041\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.google.com/maps/place/Academic%2BSurge/@38.5352334,-121.7532526,19z/data%3D!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x808529101a2c2a05:0x437ec7ca5a00065!8m2!3d38.5352324!4d-121.7527041&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465162402000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0PJKUUMf_9gCnQUBCFXxeb\">Academic Surge Building</a>, Room 1324 <br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">University of California, Davis</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Davis, CA 95616</div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
